# NOTE (fixed in this app, 17 Aug 2026 - the exact latent scaffold bug CLAUDE.md
# documents from Auto-co, 12 Aug 2026): this used to exclude
# src/demo/composition.tsx as "generated per build, never shipped in the
# package" - but composition.tsx is NOT generated boilerplate, it is this
# demo's own bespoke Shell (nav, routes, information architecture). Excluding
# it means the App frame's loadComposition() finds nothing on a fresh clone
# and the app silently falls back to the default config-shell skeleton - no
# routing, no Quality Desk archetype, no anti-sameness guarantee. Committed
# instead. Flag this upstream in the shared template - do not silently
# re-exclude it in a future scaffold; every app built from this template
# should run `git ls-files | grep composition` before trusting its repo.
